       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it: sertraline 1000 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nThe order note says the dose exceeds the 200 mg/day maximum. It also records that it's intentional per the specialist's recommendation, and that it needs pharmacist verification before dispensing. It also asks staff to monitor for serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation, and seizures.\n\nPharmacy will probably contact you about the dose. A baseline ECG, electrolytes, and a nursing monitoring plan would be reasonable to have in place before the first dose."
